    "body": "I think we should try to avoid the `String::from_utf8()` if we don't need it.\r\n`output.stdout` is a `Vec<u8>`, so we should be able to use `output.stdout.is_empty()`.\r\n\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nif stdout.is_empty() {\r\n\tlet stdout_string = String::from_utf8(stdout).unwrap();\r\n\treturn Some(stdout_string);\r\n} else {\r\n\tlet stderr_string = String::from_utf8(output.stderr).unwrap();\r\n\treturn Some(stderr_string);\r\n}\r\n```",
